        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Georgie Collins\n- Works: Ghostkeeper, Lonesome Dove: The Series\n- Concepts: Windigo legend, Wendigo psychosis\n- Places: North America\n\nFacts:\n- The Windigo legend is a legend of North America.\n- The plot of the film Ghostkeeper is inspired by the Windigo legend of North America.\n- In 1981, Georgie Collins had a role in the cult horror film Ghostkeeper.\n- Psychiatrists have described Wendigo psychosis as a controversial modern medical term and a culture-bound syndrome.\n- Wendigo psychosis is described as involving symptoms such as an intense craving for human flesh and a fear of becoming a cannibal.\n- In 1995, Georgie Collins appeared in Lonesome Dove: The Series.",
